  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWEN: Gender Equality is a right! Strengthen human and women rights activism in remote areas in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation AWEN is implementing the 12 month project &quot;Gender Equality is a right! Strengthen human and women rights activism in remote areas in Albania&quot;. The project aims to challenge anti-democractic movements and narratives across the Western Balkans and to improve the countries in the regions alignment with Istanbul Convention, e.g. re. victim/survivor centered approach, coordinated multi-sectoral service provision, and access to justice.</narrative>
  </description>
